  "term": "texture gradient",
  "definition": "Texture gradient is a pattern of change in a surface’s texture across an image that provides information about 3D shape. In visual processing models, changes in the orientation and spatial frequency of texture can be integrated to estimate local surface tilt, slant, and relative depth.",
